{
    "test_name": "MOB.386_Work_Condition_Edit_Save",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.386_Work_Condition_Edit_Save",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.386` **`Edit Item` saves \u2014 proved on the server, then restored.**\n- The fixture's permanent condition (`Pump 0102 \u00b7 Structural \u00b7 Mounting/Support`): Condition Left\n  **2 \u2192 4** on the FIRST `Edit Item` after the page loads (`updateCollectionRecord`),\n  proved by a `/graphql` read, then **4 \u2192 2** and proved again (`always`).\n- \ud83d\uded1 **Red until bugs \u00a742 is fixed:** that first Submit does nothing (the form's schema is built\n  before `GET_SCHEMA` loads). The save proof is soft, so the restore still runs.\n- The restore opens and closes `Edit Item` once first, so it saves with \u00a742 open or fixed.\n- Submit waits until `SubmitButton` is armed (`type=\"submit\"`, trap 8).\n- \ud83d\uded1 SELF-RESTORING \u2014 only a score changes; the unique key is untouched.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "Condition",
            "Edit",
            "self-restoring"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
